name: Read the exact unapproved real-model application study without starting provider work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_case.py @TARGET @ART @TARGET/../home inspect
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | manual-map
nav-mode:
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 DATA-FLOW DIAGRAM | manual-dfd
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-manual-map
paste-file: @ART/campaign-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | unapproved-passes
expect: pass 1/3
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SELECTED JOB | frozen-inputs
expect: gpt-6-luna
expect: planned
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 3 · 3 planned | unapproved-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 3 · 3 planned | unapproved-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 3 · 3 planned | unapproved-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 3 · 3 planned | unapproved-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 3 · 3 planned | unapproved-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: frozen-inputs-paged-40x12
ask: Can the operator inspect the three fixed unstarted passes and their recorded model/context/scope, without any finding or spending approval being implied?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 3 planned | returned-unstarted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_case.py @TARGET @ART @TARGET/../home verify
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/campaign-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | recovered-unapproved
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_case.py @TARGET @ART @TARGET/../home verify
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact unapproved plan and inactive context, with no queue, approved allowance, discovery attempt or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
